            <ArticleTitle>Frequency of lipid-lowering therapy after a coronary event in Helsinki, Finland.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>95, A8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The results from a survey in Finland suggest an important treatment gap of lipid-lowering medications. Patients whose coronary artery disease was diagnosed before 1995 were less likely to be on lipid therapy than patients with a more recent diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
